# repository rootをcontextにし、検証で使うファイルだけを送る。
**
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!apps/api/package.json
!apps/web/package.json
!packages/prediction/package.json
!packages/prediction/tsconfig.json
!packages/prediction/src/
!packages/prediction/src/*.ts
!packages/prediction/tests/
!packages/prediction/tests/*.ts
!packages/prediction/tests/*.mjs
!packages/prediction/scripts/
!packages/prediction/scripts/*.mjs
!packages/prediction/examples/
!packages/prediction/examples/*.mjs

# 許可したディレクトリ内にもローカル環境値・生成物を入れない。
**/.env*
**/node_modules
**/dist
